{"entryId":"1471","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1471:1","sourceSha256":"113fb1b5ba8204fe3a90a692df015c56f1d1ce62c5970c575dacd1c9644ba67b","englishSha256":"583a900854c61d8126e5022894afe69aa706b2c093c63e2ecf750aa2d2fd4e58","citations":[{"id":"1471:1:citation-01","he":[80,162],"en":[137,152],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_61b.8"},"reference":"Bava Metzia 61b:8","assessment":"The Bavli gives exactly the speaker, addressee and wording of the opening question.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bava Metzia 61b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_61b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1471:1:citation-02","he":[163,214],"en":[275,312],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bava_Metzia_61b.8.1"},"reference":"Rashi on Bava Metzia 61b:8:1","assessment":"The exact Rashi lemma distinguishes the location of Sura on the Euphrates from Sura without a qualifier.","evidence":[{"reference":"Rashi on Bava Metzia 61b:8:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bava_Metzia_61b.8.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"id":"1471:1:citation-03","he":[216,263],"en":[380,422],"target":{"entry":1171,"paragraph":1},"reference":"Seder HaDorot, Tanaim and Amoraim 1171:1","assessment":"The reciprocal entry also tentatively suggests a scribal error. The two Bavli designations remain separate.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1171:1","target":{"entry":1171,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1,2],"holds":[{"raw":"תלמיד ר' חייא בר אבא. לא ידעתי מנ\"ל","reason":"Preserve the compiler’s explicit doubt. The root offers no source for the student claim.","evidence":[]},{"raw":"אולי אחד הוא","reason":"The reciprocal entry also calls the equation conjectural. Keep the two names distinct.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1171:1","target":{"entry":1171,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The Bavli a